# PLACEHOLDER art for the Lemon Haze (sativa) strain.
#
# Re-render with:
#   python3 .claude/skills/minecraft-texture-painter/scripts/mctex.py render \
#     textures-src/sativa.mctex -o src/main/resources/assets/hempdustry/textures \
#     --preview --preview-dir /tmp/tex-preview
#
# Not covered here: item/sativa_buds.png and the block/sativa_crop_stage*.png set
# are hand-drawn art that already shipped, and item/sativa_seeds.png is a straight
# copy of item/indica_seeds.png (hemp seed is hemp seed).
#
# The spliff reuses the *exact* matrix of item/indica_spliff.png (recovered with
# `mctex extract`) with a lemon palette swapped in, so the two strains read as one
# item family and only the colour tells them apart. The wild flower is drawn fresh,
# in the same palette as the sativa_crop_stage*.png textures it stands next to.


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Spliff — same rolled diagonal as indica_spliff. The ember goes from orange-
# brown to lemon gold and the paper picks up a cream tint, so the two are
# distinguishable in the hotbar at a glance rather than only side by side.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

@palette spliff_kush
. = none
1 = 060605
2 = 170F06
3 = 141414
4 = 211A0F
5 = 211E1E
6 = 252222
7 = 403421
8 = 4A4545
9 = 64412E
a = 554940
b = 7E4321
c = 7B4C32
d = 696363
e = 936041
f = 71717109
g = AB6840
h = 947362
j = 8080800C
k = 867F7F
m = 898381
n = 8F8786
p = 9B8F84
q = 999190
r = 99999905
